  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The hardstanding, by reason of its scale, location, and materials, results in the unacceptable reduction in the potential for soft landscaping within the front garden, harms the character and appearance of the host building and the wider conservation area. Furthermore, in the absence of adequate measures to replace or enhance the biodiversity value lost, the proposal fails to demonstrate that it would not have an adverse impact on local biodiversity. As such, the development is considered contrary to Policies A1, A3, D1, D2 and CC2 of the Camden Local Plan 2017."
